<title>USA: Ecolab to expand headquarters, add jobs.</title>
<headline>Ecolab to expand headquarters, add jobs.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecolab Inc said Monday it would spend $12 million to expand its headquarters here and add as many as 600 jobs to its payroll.</p>
<p>The company currently occupies two buildings in downtown St. Paul. Ecolab plans to lease an adjacent building and create Ecolab University, a training center that will support all of its divisions.</p>
<p>Ecolab develops cleaning, sanitizing and maintenance products for the hospitality and industrial markets. The company posted sales of $2.2 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>Ecolab shares were unchanged Monday at 38.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
